# Architecture

Keep the existing layout. Do not restructure the project without a clear reason. Do not move files randomly.

```
src/features/<module>/
  components/ pages/ services/ hooks/ schemas/ types/
```

Feature UI stays in that feature. Shared UI goes in `components/common` or `components/ui`.

## Components

One responsibility, meaningful names, TypeScript props. Prefer `ArtworkCard` over `ArtworkEverything`.

Before creating a component, check for an existing Button, Input, LoadingSpinner, EmptyState, PageHeader, or similar.

## UI

Clean, art-focused, student-project appropriate. Cards, spacing, subtle shadows, responsive Tailwind grids. Avoid SaaS chrome, neon, heavy animation, and fixed widths.

Every feature must work on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
